r safe grain crossings and pledging Hollow labour to the repairs."},{"id":"rel_odric_corvin_rival","source_character_id":"chr_odric_vane","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_halewind","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Odric Vane resents Corvin Halewind for tolls that choke the cloudstone supply he needs, deepening the Toll War between Wardens and Cartel."}]}
