es responsibility and gives Marcellus the repair ledgers.","personality_traits":["meticulous","secretive","dutiful"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Skilled at braiding and inspecting cloudstone skybridge cable.","category":"technological"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_vane_crass_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_marcellus_vane","target_character_id":"chr_tiberon_crass","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Marcellus Vane schemes to expose Tiberon Crass, whose rise as a demagogue is built on the same toll crisis Marcellus once failed to resolve."},{"id":"rel_crass_vane_rival","source_character_id":"chr_tiberon_crass","target_character_id":"chr_marcellus_vane","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Tiberon Crass mocks Marcellus Vane to the crowds as a fallen elitist, amplifying public scorn against him."},{"id":"rel_vane_quill_ally","source_character_id":"chr_marcellus_vane","target_character_id":"chr_lysandra_quill","relationship_type":"reluctant ally","description":"Marcellus Vane needs Lysandra Quill's testimony against the grain levy, but she distrusts his motives and demands his honesty."},{"id":"rel_halcyon_vane_ally","source_character_id":"chr_oren_halcyon","target_character_id":"chr_marcellus_vane","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Oren Halcyon supplies Marcellus Vane with repair ledgers, but his secrecy about his past cable failure strains their trust."},{"id":"rel_crass_quill_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_tiberon_crass","target_character_id":"chr_lysandra_quill","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Tiberon Crass uses the Cartel's grain levy to pressure Lysandra Quill and threatens to blacklist the Hollow's barges."}]}
