ilds an alliance with the Wardens.","personality_traits":["grounded","wary","generous","blunt"],"abilities":[{"name":"Wind Reading","description":"Predicts gusts and storms days ahead from the mills' vane behaviour.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_isolde_fenn","name":"Isolde Fenn","role":"supporting","description":"A 41-year-old cartographer at Silverspine Academy, thin and ink-stained, with round brass spectacles and a habit of sketching bridge routes on her sleeves.","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To chart a complete, accurate skybridge map that proves how the drift endangers bridges.","goal":"Publish a survey exposing which bridges are unsafe because of unpaid maintenance.","flaw":"Avoids conflict and withholds findings until they are flawless.","internal_conflict":"She fears that publishing incomplete data may spark panic, but delay may cost lives.","external_conflict":"Cartel agents pressure the Academy to suppress her bridge-safety survey.","arc":"Isolde begins by hoarding her findings. When Mira shows her a frayed cable that matches her data, she publishes the incomplete survey despite Cartel threats. She ends as a public voice for bridge safety.","personality_traits":["precise","timid","curious","principled"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge Cartography","description":"Models drift patterns to predict bridge strain.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mira_corvin_toll","source_character_id":"chr_mira_veldt","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_adair","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Mira Veldt blames Corvin Adair's tolls for starving bridge maintenance, and Corvin treats her audit campaign as a threat to his monopoly."},{"id":"rel_corvin_tamsin_levy","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_adair","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_orrel","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corvin Adair imposes the grain levy on Tamsin Orrel's mills, and Tamsin organises resistance to break his 